    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Great Pyramid of Giza in Egypt is the oldest of the seven wonders of the ancient world. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "structure",
            "ref": "v-structure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was built more than 4,500 years ago. It has never stopped surprising us in its long history. Scientists have recently discovered a hidden "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "passage",
            "ref": "v-passage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " inside the pyramid."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The passage is just above the main entrance to the pyramid. It’s about nine metres long and two metres wide. It has a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "triangular ceiling",
            "ref": "v-triangular-ceiling"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The pyramid has three known "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "chambers"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They were built as the resting place of King Khufu and his queen. But what about the newly discovered passage? Nobody knows for sure."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "There might be “something important” below the passage. “It was very likely created to protect the chambers,” said an Egyptian "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "official",
            "zh": "官员"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", “for example, by reducing the stress from the weight of the building materials on the pyramid.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The discovery was part of the ScanPyramids project. The project began in October 2015. A group of scientists from across the world are taking part in it. Thanks to modern technology, they’re now able to “see” the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "internal",
            "ref": "v-internal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " structures of the pyramid. We expect more discoveries "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "in the near future",
            "ref": "v-near-future"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
